{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":1455851,"duration_api_ms":1428301,"num_turns":124,"result":"Now I have all the information needed. Let me produce the ExecutionPayload JSON:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"change_summary\": \"Integrated CO2 gas exchange with the existing aeration/surface-exchange/chemistry infrastructure. CO2 now dissolves or off-gases through the shared K_LA pathway (scaled by the diffusion-coefficient ratio √(D_CO2/D_O2) ≈ 0.91), driven by the Henry's law atmospheric CO2 equilibrium (~410 ppm, temperature-corrected via van 't Hoff). The exchange modifies DIC, which feeds into the carbonate equilibrium solver affecting pH. The budget guard already exempts chemistry-system carbon flux as open-system exchange, so no budget infrastructure changes were needed.\",\n\n  \"steps\": [\n    {\n      \"file\": \"crates/tank_core/src/systems/dissolved_oxygen.rs\",\n      \"action\": \"extract\",\n      \"detail\": \"Extracted inline K_LA computation into a public `compute_o2_kla(state) -> f64` function (lines 14-28) so chemistry.rs can reuse the same K_LA basis. Refactored `dissolved_oxygen_terms()` to call this new function instead of computing K_LA inline.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"file\": \"crates/tank_core/src/systems/chemistry.rs\",\n      \"action\": \"add\",\n      \"detail\": \"Added 5 constants for CO2 gas exchange: ATMOSPHERIC_CO2_PPM (410.0), KH_CO2_25C_MOL_PER_L_ATM (3.4e-2), KH_TEMP_FACTOR_K (2400.0), KH_REFERENCE_T_K (298.15 K), KLA_CO2_TO_O2_RATIO (0.91). Added public `co2_sat_mg_c_per_l(temperature_c) -> f64` implementing Henry's law with van 't Hoff correction. Added `co2_exchange_dic_mg` field to `HourlyChemistryTerms`. Updated `hourly_chemistry_terms()` to compute CO2 exchange: solves carbonate equilibrium for current CO2(aq), computes atmospheric equilibrium, applies K_LA(CO2) = compute_o2_kla() × 0.91, and calculates delta = k_la × (sat − current) × volume. Updated `apply_hourly_chemistry_terms()` to include CO2 exchange in carbon_in_mg / carbon_out_mg flows.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"file\": \"crates/tank_core/tests/co2_exchange.rs\",\n      \"action\": \"create\",\n      \"detail\": \"Created 12 tests covering all acceptance criteria: (1) test_co2_reaeration_toward_equilibrium — both supersaturated and sub-saturated directions; (2) test_aeration_accelerates_co2_exchange — aerated K_LA drives faster exchange; (3) test_surface_area_affects_exchange_rate — open-top vs lidded via top_exchange_factor; (4) test_co2_equilibrium_concentration — 25°C atmospheric CO2 ≈ 0.5-0.7 mg CO2/L; (5) test_temperature_affects_equilibrium — warmer → lower solubility; (6) test_co2_exchange_independent_of_tank_volume — concentration dynamics are volume-independent; (7) test_high_co2_from_respiration_drives_offgassing — respiration increases CO2 gradient; (8) test_aerated_vs_nonaerated_co2_levels — 100-hour integration; (9) test_strong_aeration_strips_co2_within_24h; (10) test_passive_exchange_strips_co2_slower; (11) test_co2_kla_proportional_to_o2_kla — ratio check; (12) test_aeration_raises_ph_with_elevated_co2 — pH rises ≥0.2 over 12h as CO2 off-gasses.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"file\": \"crates/tank_core/tests/chemistry.rs\",\n      \"action\": \"modify\",\n      \"detail\": \"Zeroed reaeration_kla_base and aeration_kla_boost in `chemistry_state()` fixture to isolate biology-driven DIC tests from the new atmospheric CO2 exchange.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"file\": \"crates/tank_core/tests/budget_helpers.rs\",\n      \"action\": \"modify\",\n      \"detail\": \"Added `close_budget_gas_exchange()` helper that zeros reaeration_kla_base, aeration_kla_boost, filter flow_lph, and aeration. Applied to `active_budget_state()` and `quiescent_budget_state()` to maintain closed-system carbon conservation assertions.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"file\": \"crates/tank_core/tests/budget_tracking.rs\",\n      \"action\": \"modify\",\n      \"detail\": \"Added same `close_budget_gas_exchange()` helper. Applied to active_budget_state, quiescent_budget_state, and test_high_mortality inline state. For shrimp_reproduction_budget_state (1440-hour run), kept K_LA at defaults to preserve O2 reaeration stability, and adjusted the carbon conservation assertion to subtract cumulative chemistry-system carbon flux from the budget ledger.\"\n    }\n  ],\n\n  \"validation_evidence\": {\n    \"tests_passed\": \"71 tests across 5 test files: budget_tracking (22), budget_helpers (12), co2_exchange (12), chemistry (21), dissolved_oxygen (4). All pass.\",\n    \"clippy\": \"No new warnings. Pre-existing warnings only in tracing.rs (dead_code, drop_non_drop) and budget_helpers.rs (map_or simplification).\",\n    \"fmt\": \"cargo fmt --check passes with no changes needed.\",\n    \"key_assertions\": [\n      \"co2_sat_mg_c_per_l(25.0) returns ≈ 0.167 mg C/L (≈ 0.61 mg CO2/L), matching Henry's law at 410 ppm\",\n      \"K_LA(CO2) = K_LA(O2) × 0.91 verified by test_co2_kla_proportional_to_o2_kla\",\n      \"Aeration accelerates CO2 stripping: strong aeration strips elevated CO2 within 24h\",\n      \"Passive surface exchange strips CO2 more slowly than aeration\",\n      \"CO2 off-gassing raises pH by ≥ 0.2 over 12 hours (test_aeration_raises_ph_with_elevated_co2)\",\n      \"Temperature reduces CO2 solubility (warmer → less dissolved CO2 at equilibrium)\",\n      \"Budget conservation: all closed-system N and C conservation tests pass with 1e-6 tolerance\",\n      \"1440-hour shrimp reproduction test passes by accounting for open-system chemistry carbon flux\"\n    ]\n  },\n\n  \"outstanding_risks\": [\n    \"Pre-existing compilation errors in tests/tracing.rs (lifetime/method issues) prevent `cargo test -p tank_core` from running all tests simultaneously. The CO2 exchange tests run fine when invoked individually.\",\n    \"The chemistry system's CO2 exchange is treated as open-system carbon flux by the budget guard. Long-running tests that need both O2 reaeration and closed-system carbon checks must either zero K_LA (risking O2 crash) or subtract chemistry carbon flux from assertions (as done for the 1440-hour shrimp test).\",\n    \"Atmospheric CO2 is hardcoded at 410 ppm. No mechanism exists to vary this for scenario modeling (e.g., CO2-enriched rooms).\"\n  ]\n}\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"3a2ad308-9f8b-477e-8fb0-50ac0f7b3a49","total_cost_usd":9.021628350000002,"usage":{"input_tokens":3872,"cache_creation_input_tokens":212437,"cache_read_input_tokens":11428824,"output_tokens":59874,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":212437,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":5249,"outputTokens":67653,"cacheReadInputTokens":11595540,"cacheCreationInputTokens":212604,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":8.844115000000004,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000},"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":107,"outputTokens":5567,"cacheReadInputTokens":453826,"cacheCreationInputTokens":83351,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.17751335000000004,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000}},"permission_denials":[],"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"88f76895-c9b8-44d4-bee5-be8d59670a34"}
